    "title": "Virginia offers free fishing days June 5-7 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dakota Griffin ,\n1 days ago CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. (WVIR) - Fishing permits normally cost $18, but June 5-7, anglers can fish without any additional costs. Free fishing days allow people to enjoy recreational rod and reel fishing in both fresh and saltwater without purchasing a fishing license. The Virginia Department of Wildlife Resources is hosting events... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
